        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-repair-basic-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Ask for repetition and slower speech",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "If listening did not result in understanding, say 没听懂 rather than pretending to understand. 请 before a request is polite, and 再 requests a new occurrence after this point. Combine the signal with a short request for repetition.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我没听懂。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ méi tīngdǒng 。",
                "meaning": "I did not understand what I heard.",
                "audio": "fb59d1106b94cebc03bec4944c050f154107c7229c464b5f2d5ce307f5e79bf1"
              },
              {
                "text": "请再说。",
                "pinyin": "qǐng zài shuō 。",
                "meaning": "Please say it again.",
                "audio": "448dc296e53053aaf26a536dc2467ad1122a765c886ff02877c7f4efeb67e3bb"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
